  "notes": "{合計|ごうけい} means the total when adding numbers together. Composed of {合|ごう} (combine) + {計|けい} (count).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {合計|ごうけい}で〜: in total\n- {合計|ごうけい}する: to total, to add up\n- {合計|ごうけい}{金額|きんがく}: total amount\n- {合計|ごうけい}〜{人|にん}/{個|こ}/{円|えん}: ~ in total\n\nGRAMMAR:\nCan be used as a noun ({合計|ごうけい}は100{円|えん}だ) or with する as a verb ({合計|ごうけい}すると200{円|えん}になる).\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {総計|そうけい}: grand total (more formal, emphasizes everything included)\n- {計|けい}: total (shorter, casual — {計|けい}10{個|こ})\n- {小計|しょうけい}: subtotal",
